    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we optimize costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected, considering the need for a progressive deployment approach?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. would consider a phased approach to the project, aligning with the client's requirement for progressive deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard daily rates and pricing model, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can allocate resources efficiently across the four-year period. our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. target gross margin percentage is 28%, and our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a minimum acceptable margin of 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering these parameters, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. would aim to balance cost optimization with the quality of service delivery. our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. infrastructure margin percentage is 12%, which could be applied to hosting and maintaining the solution on a suitable infrastructure, such as SecNumCloud or equivalent, as specified by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For a project of this nature, involving AI solutions and integration with existing systems, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. team composition would likely include senior architects, project managers, AI engineers, and security engineers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard daily rates for senior architects, project managers, AI engineers, and security engineers, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can estimate personnel costs and ensure that personnel costs align with the client's budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the total budget of 3 million euros over four years, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. would propose a detailed breakdown of costs across each year, considering both the development phase and the subsequent maintenance and support phases. a detailed breakdown of costs across each year ensures transparency in cost allocation and helps in managing the annual cost of exploitation effectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with similar projects, such as the Comune di Brescia mobility hub, suggests that a modular and scalable approach can help manage costs while adapting to evolving client needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By prioritizing functionalities and deploying functionalities progressively, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that the solution meets the immediate needs of the City of Belval while staying within budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific cost-saving measures, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. could absorb some costs through rate renegotiation with subcontractors if necessary, as indicated by our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. cost sensitivity data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, for a project of this scope, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. primary focus would be on delivering high-quality services that meet all regulatory and performance requirements rather than solely on cost reduction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, the key to optimizing costs in the project will lie in careful planning, phased deployment, and continuous monitoring of expenses against the allocated budget, ensuring that the City of Belval receives a high-quality AI solution that enhances the City of Belval administrative services without exceeding the City of Belval financial capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The artificial intelligence solution should assist agents in agents daily missions by facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The artificial intelligence solution must also provide help with drafting administrative contents, assist in the instruction of files, and facilitate collaboration and continuity of file processing between agents and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategies can we employ to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements, we can leverage we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned for specific administrative tasks using methods like LoRA or QLoRA to achieve an average accuracy gain of 12%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For information retrieval and contextualization, we can employ RAG capabilities with dense vector semantic search, BM25 sparse search, or hybrid approaches, utilizing vector stores like Qdrant or Weaviate. employ will enable agents to access relevant information quickly and efficiently." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To assist with drafting administrative contents, we LLMs can be used to generate high-quality text based on context and requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For example, we can use we experience with models like CamemBERT for French-language tasks to help draft letters or answers to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For file instruction assistance, RAG can provide relevant information and suggest actions or verifications to carry out, taking into account the context of the file. we innovation pipeline's current research topics on knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning may also be applicable here." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate collaboration and continuity of processing between agents and services, we can implement sharing of relevant information and understanding of file context using we RAG capabilities. implement will enable effective resumption of file processing by another agent. we explainability and transparency methods, such as source citation and chain-of-thought display, will ensure that the solution's recommendations and proposals are understandable and justifiable. we will also prioritize data protection, hosting data exclusively within the EU and ensuring compliance with GDPR regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI components and innovation strategies, we can develop a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution that meets the client's requirements and improves the efficiency of the client's administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to limit The City of Belval environmental footprint through sustainable development policies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure The solution aligns with sustainable development policies, considering the hosting on SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To align with sustainable development policies, The solution can leverage green hosting partners such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both located in France and utilizing 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Although green hosting partners such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both located in France and utilizing 100% renewable energy may not be explicitly mentioned as SecNumCloud or equivalent, green hosting partners such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both located in France and utilizing 100% renewable energy ISO14001 certification and high renewable energy percentage are notable.  we can also highlight we digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching for an estimated 20% recompute reduction, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These measures contribute to reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we carbon reporting capability, based on the GRI Standards (partial), can help monitor and report The solution environmental impact. we typically achieve around 35% energy reduction versus baseline, which aligns with the goal of minimizing the environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating these environmentally friendly practices into The solution, we can ensure The solution supports sustainable development policies while meeting The City of Belval requirements for hosting on infrastructure like SecNumCloud or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is pleased to submit Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposal in response to the City of Belval's call for tenders for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has extensive experience in managing complex projects, particularly in the public sector, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are confident that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise aligns with the City of Belval's objectives. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents will provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying the agents' in the agents' administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will facilitate access to reliable and up-to-date information, assist with drafting administrative contents, and provide accompaniment in the instruction of files. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents will also suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful project coordination and governance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience in managing complex projects and adopt a phased methodology, such as PRINCE2 or Agile Scrum." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A steering committee will oversee the project's progress, meeting monthly to review progress, discuss challenges, and make strategic decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will also maintain a RAID log and decision log to track risks, assumptions, issues, and decisions throughout the project's." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technical architecture will utilize large language models (LLMs) such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon, as well as retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) frameworks like LangChain, LlamaIndex, and Haystack." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will employ API gateways like Kong or Apigee to facilitate secure and standardized interactions between an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents and various business software, civil status, town planning, electronic document management (EDM) systems, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure high availability and performance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, or ELK stack to track system health and optimize response times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. target is to achieve a time of response lower than 2 seconds for current requests, with a high level of relevance of the answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will also guarantee an availability of 99.9%, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

