        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project must be conducted in a progressive manner with a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by progressive generalization to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What steps can we take to ensure successful project coordination and governance, considering the need for change management and training of agents?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful project coordination and governance for the City of Belval's artificial intelligence solution implementation, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will leverage our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience in managing complex projects, particularly in the public sector." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirement for a progressive approach with a pilot phase, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will adopt a phased methodology, such as PRINCE2 or Agile Scrum, which are part of our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. project management capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will establish a clear governance structure that includes setting up a steering committee to oversee The project progress and ensure alignment with the City of Belval's objectives. a steering committee to oversee the project's progress and ensure alignment with the city's objectives will meet monthly, as per our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. typical reporting cadence, to review progress, discuss challenges, and make strategic decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will maintain a RAID log and decision log to track risks, assumptions, issues, and decisions throughout The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For change management and training of agents, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will assign a dedicated change manager who will be responsible for developing and delivering targeted training programs. targeted training programs will include in-person workshops and e-learning modules tailored to the needs of the municipal agents, ensuring the municipal agents are comfortable using the new AI solution. our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. approach to user adoption tracking will also be applied to monitor the effectiveness of the training and identify areas where additional support may be needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the City of Belval's emphasis on sovereignty and data protection, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure that the new AI solution is hosted on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure or equivalent, within the European Union, to comply with GDPR requirements. our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. known partner, EuroCloud Solutions S.A., specializing in sovereign cloud hosting, could potentially be involved in this aspect of The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To manage risks effectively, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will maintain a risk register and review a risk register bi-weekly, categorizing risks into technical, financial, regulatory, operational, and reputational categories. our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. risk appetite is low-to-medium, which aligns with the City of Belval's need for a reliable and secure solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, to ensure The project stays within budget and meets the environmental constraints, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will work closely with the City of Belval's to optimize costs and propose solutions that reduce energetic consumption, possibly leveraging our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partnership with GreenCompute S.r.l., who specializes in green IT and energy-efficient infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following this structured approach, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. believe our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can successfully coordinate and govern The project, meeting the City of Belval's requirements for an effective AI solution implementation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide times of response compatible with daily use by agents (less than 2 seconds), integrate with existing information systems (business softwares, civil status, town planning, electronic document management, user directories) using API-type interfaces, and guarantee high availability (99.9%) and relevance of answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the technical architecture to meet these performance, integration, and availability requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these performance, integration, and availability requirements, the technical architecture will leverage we expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, data engineering, and cybersecurity.  we will utilize we experience with large language models (LLMs) such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon to develop an intelligent assistance tool that provides relevant answers. we Rag frameworks expertise, including LangChain, LlamaIndex, and Haystack, will enable we to design a robust question-answering system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with existing information systems, we will employ API gateways like Kong or Apigee to facilitate secure and standardized interactions between The solution and various business softwares, civil status, town planning, electronic document management (EDM) systems such as Alfresco, Maarch Courrier, or OpenKM, and user directories using protocols like Active Directory / LDAP, Keycloak, or FranceConnect. we cloud architecture expertise with providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, Outscale (SecNumCloud), and Azure (EU regions) will allow we to design a scalable and secure infrastructure. we can utilize containerization technologies such as Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm for efficient deployment and management of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure high availability and performance, we will implement monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, or ELK stack to track system health and optimize response times. we experience with inference servers such as vLLM, Ollama, or TGI (Hugging Face) will help in optimizing the LLM inference workflow for low latency. we can achieve the required availability of 99.9% by implementing hybrid deployments across multiple cloud providers, on-premise setups, and leveraging we experience with auto-scaling to zero, which allows for dynamic resource allocation based on demand." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we will apply we knowledge of explainability tools such as SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought prompting, or RAG source citation to ensure the transparency and explicability of the AI-driven recommendations, adhering to regulatory requirements like GDPR for data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these technical capabilities, we can design a robust, integrated, and highly available AI-powered assistance solution that meets the City of Belval's performance, integration, and availability requirements while ensuring compliance with regulatory constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must comply with GDPR, ensuring data is hosted exclusively within the EU, not transferred outside the EU, and protected appropriately (encryption, anonymization if necessary)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also provide explicability and transparency in The solution recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we security and compliance posture meets these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Security & Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have experience with GDPR compliance, having a Data Protection Officer appointed and contactable at dpo@nexus-engineering.it." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency policy ensures that all data is stored within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits data transfers outside the EU unless there's an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. utilize anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have implemented various data subject rights, including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explicability and transparency, Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "AI security controls include output PII redaction and confidence threshold escalation, which can help provide insights into the recommendations made by Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "AI-powered solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have ISO 27001 certification with a scope that includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, which demonstrates Nexus Engineering S.r.l. commitment to information security and compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "ISO 27001 certification is valid until November 30, 2026." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also conduct Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) as needed, with an average duration of 3 weeks, to ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solutions comply with GDPR requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With these measures in place, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. security and compliance posture meets the regulatory requirements outlined in the Call for Tenders." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract must respect regulatory requirements, including GDPR for data protection, and ensure no decision is automated without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with all relevant EU regulations (GDPR for data protection, EU AI Act)?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, we should flag the following legal risks: open-source license compliance, cross-border data flow, although since it's intra-EU only, no issue is expected, EU AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation.  we are compliant with GDPR for data protection as we standard legal basis is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we have a data protection agreement template version available. we also ensure that all client data remains the sole property of the contracting authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding EU AI Act, we have expertise in this area, are aware of prohibited AI practices, and can ensure transparency obligations for limited-risk AI, as well as enforce human oversight contractually. we also have a policy of not allowing automated decisions without human validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, it appears that we is compliant with the relevant EU regulations mentioned, including GDPR for data protection and EU AI Act, considering we existing policies and expertise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain mastered and compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

